OL,3,ANorway's new king remembers 'my dear
OL,4,Afather' in first speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Haakon VIII of Norway has paid
OL,7,Fwarm tribute to his late father, Harald
OL,8,FV, in his first speech to the nation
OL,9,Fsince taking the throne.
OL,11,F"Thank you for being such a good dad,"
OL,12,Fhe said in an at-times emotional
OL,13,Ftelevised address, seated at a desk in
OL,14,FNorway's royal palace, beside a picture
OL,15,Fof the late king, two lit candles and a
OL,16,Fbowl of white roses.
OL,18,FHarald, 89, who was seen as a
OL,19,Fmoderniser and "people's king" during
OL,20,Fhis 35-year reign, died in hospital on
OL,21,FFriday morning after being treated for
OL,22,Fa rare blood condition.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
