OL,3,ANorway's new king remembers 'my dear
OL,4,Afather' in first speech
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Now it is my turn," his 53-year-old
OL,7,Fson said, adding that a "major task"
OL,8,Fawaited him and that he wished to be
OL,9,F"present and attentive" going forward.
